       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SUPER8-CARR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SUPER8-CARR-PROOFS.
           05  WS-GATE-TRANSFER-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CARRIER-TILT-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ROTARY-SHUTTER-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SUPER8-LATENCY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SUPER8-SEAL-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SUPER8-CARR-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PS8-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PS8-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-GATE-AND-TILT.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SHUTTER-AND-LAT.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PS8-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-GATE-AND-TILT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GATE-TRANSFER-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CARRIER-TILT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SHUTTER-AND-LAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ROTARY-SHUTTER-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SUPER8-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PS8-PROOFS.
           IF WS-GATE-TRANSFER-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CARRIER-TILT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ROTARY-SHUTTER-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SUPER8-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SUPER8-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PS8-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PS8-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PS8-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PS8-CODE.
